# on-the-fly, single material + PML (npml=2) on left/right/bottom (free surface on top)
# base grid 10 x 6 over [0,0.05]x[0,0.03]; extended to 14 x 8 by the 2 PML rings on W/E/D.
0.0        # xmin
0.05       # xmax
0.005      # xstep    -> base nelemx = 10
0.03       # zmax (top)
1          # nlayers
0.03 6     # layer 0: thickness  nsteps  -> base nelemz = 6
2          # has_pml = npml (2 PML element layers)
0 1        # pml_top pml_bottom  (no top PML, yes bottom PML; W/E always on when npml>0)
5 2 10. 0. 0.   # ngllPML  npow  Apow  omegac  kc
4          # mesh_type (Quad4)
